  "description": "(3.0.1) Model-alignment / abliteration contract surface — pattern-port of OBLITERATUS. IAlignmentToolkit lets a host run targeted abliteration on a downloaded model (e.g. remove refusals that don't apply on private on-device deployments), IAlignmentProfile captures a reversible alignment delta, IAlignmentAuditor enforces \"do not ship abliterated weights upstream\". Null impls fail-closed.",
